","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Behold. 9,11; Isa 38:14 my bowels. 2:11; Job 30:27; Ps 22:14; Isa 16:11; Jer 4:19; 31:20; 48:36 Ho 11:8; Hab 3:16 for. 18; Le 26:40-42; 1Ki 8:47-50; Job 33:27; Ps 51:3,4; Pr 28:13 Jer 2:35; 3:13; Lu 15:18,19; 18:13,14 abroad. 4:9,10; De 32:25; Jer 9:21,22; 14:18; Eze 7:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-1-21","title":"Lamentations 1:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>have heard that. 2,8,11,12,16,22 they are. 2:15; 4:21,22; Ps 35:15; 38:16; 137:7; Jer 48:27; 50:11 Eze 25:3,6,8,15; 26:2; Ob 1:12,13 thou wilt. Isa 13:1-14:32; 47:1-15; Jer 25:17-29; 46:1-51:64; Eze 25:1-32:32 Am 1:1-15 the day. Ps 37:13; Joe 3:14 called. or, proclaimed. they shall. 4:22; De 32:41-43; Ps 137:8,9; Isa 51:22,23; Jer 50:15,29,31 Jer 51:24,49; Mic 7:9,10; Hab 2:15-17; Re 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-1-22","title":"Lamentations 1:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>all their. Ne 4:4,5; Ps 109:14,15; 137:7-9; Jer 10:25; 18:23; 51:35; Lu 23:31 Re 6:10 my heart. 13; 5:17; Isa 13:7; Jer 8:18; Eph 3:13</p>"}]}